<title>UK: TABLE-Aegis pre-tax profit rises 18 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Aegis pre-tax profit rises 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.3		    vs 2.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.35		   vs nil</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 0.60		   vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     39.6		   vs 33.6</p>
<p> Turnover		  3,453		   vs 3,401</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 38.2 and 39.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Aegis Group Plc.</p>
